WEBVTT

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:30.169
cha kila tunachofanya

00:00:30.169 --> 00:00:34.047
na chochote tunachokuwa pamoja nacho,

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:37.304
ni kwamba wote

00:00:37.304 --> 00:00:40.341
tunataka kuwa na furaha.

00:00:40.341 --> 00:00:43.203
Katika hili,tupo pamoja.

00:00:43.203 --> 00:00:46.695
Tunavyofikiria furaha yetu.

00:00:46.695 --> 00:00:48.701
inatofautiana kati ya mtu mmoja na mwingine,

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:53.529
lakini ni vitu tulivyonavyo kwa pamoja,

00:00:53.529 --> 00:00:57.164
tunataka kuwa na furaha.

00:00:57.164 --> 00:01:00.486
Sasa,mada yangu ni kuhusu kushukuru.